## Best Practices for Quarto

A reproducible workflow requires more than code.

✓ Render often  
✓ Keep files organized  
✓ Write narrative alongside analysis  
✓ Document decisions  
✓ Use meaningful chunk labels  
✓ Save source files with projects  
✓ Embrace reproducibility

::: notes

These aren't Quarto requirements—they're habits that make projects easier to maintain.

Future you will appreciate meaningful chunk labels.

Future collaborators will appreciate clear narrative.

And your future self will definitely appreciate rendering frequently instead of waiting until the end.

The goal is reproducibility, not perfection.

:::

